    "Ibn Abbas also said the jinn used to catch one true word of revelation and add ten lies to it; after his mission any jinn that sat to listen was struck by a burning meteor. Iblis sent his troops, who found the Prophet ﷺ praying at Nakhlah: 'This is what has happened on earth.'",
