    "Abu Hurayrah: at the Jewish study-house the Prophet ﷺ asked for their most learned man, Abdullah ibn Suriya, and adjured him by Allah's favours to the Israelites. Ibn Suriya admitted: 'Yes, and they know what I know; your description is clear in the Torah, but they envy you.' He feared to break with his people.",
